join Ezekiel (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
Ezekiel: Right. Your plot.
- Ezekiel — what's all this?
	Hope: Ezekiel — what's all this?
	Ezekiel: It's what I owe you and I'd like to get on with it before the ground goes hard.
	- You don't owe me anything
		Hope: You don't owe me anything.
		Ezekiel: I do, and I've been carrying it since winter, and it's heavier than the barrow.
		Ezekiel: So. You'll do the digging, because my knees are finished. I'll tell you where.
	- Where do we start?
		Hope: Where do we start?
		Ezekiel: Good. That's the right question.
set {GameState.quest_ezekiel_repay_hope} = "active"
[signal arg="objective:Work Hope's plot under Ezekiel's direction — zai pits, mulch, stone catchment"]
